  "privacyIntro": "Rxvarta is built so that patient records stay under the doctor's control. This page explains, in plain words, where data is kept, who processes it and how to delete it.",
  "privacyWhereStoredTitle": "Where your data lives",
  "privacyWhereStoredDevice": "This device — patients, visits, transcripts, prescriptions, report photos and recordings are kept in the app's private storage on this phone.",
  "privacyWhereStoredCloud": "Supabase project hosted in Mumbai, India (ap-south-1) — your account, doctor profile, signature and backups.",
  "privacyWhereStoredAudio": "Recordings are uploaded to a private storage bucket only for processing, never for long-term storage.",
