  "privacyProcessorGoogle": "Google Gemini — turns the transcript into a structured draft prescription for you to review.",
  "privacyProcessorSupabase": "Supabase — sign-in, file storage and the database behind your account.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "How long it is kept",
