  "privacyRetentionJobs": "Processing cache: cleared after the result has been delivered to the app.",
  "privacyRoleTitle": "Your role and ours",
  "privacyRoleBody": "Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 you, the doctor, remain the data fiduciary for your patients' records. Rxvarta processes them only on your instructions, as a data processor.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "Security measures",
  "privacySecurityBody": "Data travels over encrypted connections (TLS). Records on the server are protected by per-account access rules, so only your sign-in can read them. Keep your phone locked: anyone who can unlock it can open the app.",
